# Root-level build context is used by the REST/Kafka shiny base image so it can
# COPY the local statesnap package. Exclude everything heavy/irrelevant to keep
# the build context small — the base image only needs ./statesnap.
.git
**/node_modules
k6/results
analysis
docs
Proof-of-Concept
whole_apps
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/target
**/dist
**/.angular
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
